  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia - Crises to Resilience (EC2R)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EC2R is a flexible programme which will i) provide multi-sector humanitarian assistance to meets the needs of Ethiopia&#x2019;s most vulnerable populations; ii) support poor households so they are better able to withstand disasters and shocks; and iii) invest in the humanitarian system so it is able to identify risks and respond early and cost-effectively.
ERCS will receive funding directly from FCDO, and the programme will work in consortium with UNICEF, WFP, World Bank, REACH and Save the Children</narrative>
  </description>
